  lines:
  - "Doctor Moss? Are you there?\r\nWe\u2019re the rescue team sent to save your
    crew."
  - Yes I am here.
  - "I\u2019ve found a good spot to hide from it in a small cave. I believe it\u2019s
    south west of the radio tower."
  - Have you found any of the others yet?
  - 'No not yet. The channel list here only has you and Captain Sharp on it. '
  - "But I\u2019m afraid it was too late for her\u2026"
  - He doesn't respond, but his silence is loud.
  - Do you have any information on the others that could help?
  - "Right. My medical records that I\u2019ve been keeping are in my bag. I dropped
    it on the way here though."
  - It could still be by the tower somewhere.
  - Ok thank you. I am sending people your way.
  - I should contact the team.
  lineSFX: 060000000100000001000000010000000600000000000000010000000600000001000000010000000600000000000000
